try within robotic organisms.\n\nSource: Dismantled from Mirewinder servofish via The Business in Fortuna (Venus). Catch Mirewinder in Orb Vallis caves during any weather. Also drops from resource containers across the Orb Vallis.","Controla el flujo eléctrico a través de la circuitería dentro de los organismos robóticos.\n\nFuente: Se obtiene al desarmar al servopez Lodobobina con The Business en Fortuna (Venus). Captura a Lodobobina en las cuevas de los Valles del Orbe durante cualquier clima. También se obtiene de los contenedores de recursos en los Valles del Orbe."],"img":"storeicons-fishing-venus-fishpartparallelbiode","planets":[],"sources":[],"usedIn":[],"refs":{}},"murkray-liver":{"slug":"murkray-liver","slugEs":"higado-de-raya-oscura","name":["Murkray Liver","Hígado de raya oscura"],"desc":["An ingredient used in Ostron cooking and medicine.\n\nSource: Cut from Murkray fish via Fisher Hai-Luk in Cetus (Earth). Catch Murkray in Plains of Eidolon ocean hotspots at any time of day using Murkray Bait. Also drops from Thumpers in the Plains of Eidolon.","Un ingrediente utilizado en la cocina y la medicina de los ostronitas.\n\nOrigen: Obtenido de las rayas oscuras con la Pescadora Hai-Luk en Cetus (Tierra). Captura rayas oscuras en las zonas activas del océano de las Llanuras de Eidolon a cualquier hora del día usando carnada de raya oscura. También se obtienen de los pistones en las Llanuras de Eidolon."],"img":"storeicons-fishing-eidolon-fishresourceorgan","planets":[],"sources":[{"k":"enemy","who":"Tusk Thumper Doma","eff":33.36},{"k":"enemy","who":"Tusk Thumper Bull","eff":25.02},{"k":"enemy","who":"Tusk Thumper","eff":16.68},{"k":"enemy","who":"Narmer Thumper Doma","eff":33.36},{"k":"enemy","who":"Narmer Thumper Bull","eff":25.02},{"k":"enemy","who":"Narmer Thumper","eff":16.68}],"usedIn":["Powersuits/Devourer/Devourer"],"refs":{"Powersuits/Devourer/Devourer":{"tab":"arsenal","slug":"grendel","slugEs":"grendel","name":["Grendel","Grendel"],"img":"storeicon